==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ancient Origins|Whimsicott|56}} from the {{TCG|Ancient Origins}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Rolling Tackle''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Dark Electrode|34}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

